r rest, but Zhegrova and Conceicao are back, Celik may start and Venezia's Yeboah-Adams pair is expected, so I drop the lean and stay at about 2.5."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 11 corners","text":"The numbers say 10.9 corners, already raised for Juve's big recent corner count (+12%). Venezia defending deep in a 3-5-2 should give Juve plenty of corners, with McKennie and Cabal wide and Zhegrova or Conceicao off the bench, but that is the picture the numbers already have, so I stay at about 10.9."},"cards":{"lean":"higher","adjust_pct":3,"call":"Around 2.9 cards","text":"The numbers say 2.8 cards, cut for both teams' quiet recent run (about -10% and -13%) and for Arena's low record on just three games. Venezia are fighting relegation away at a big club and Nicola's sides defend with plenty of duels, which a three-game referee sample can't capture; a mild lean up to about 2.9."},"shots":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 30 shots","text":"The numbers say 30.4 shots, already lifted for Venezia's recent shooting (+18%). Juve will have the ball against a compact block with Kolo Muani, Woltemade and Alajbegovic up front and attacking options back on the bench, and Venezia are expected to start their usual strikers, so I stay at about 30.4."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 9 on target","text":"The numbers say 8.9 shots on target, most of them in Juve's hands (6.0). Juve's expected front three is their usual one, Venezia keep Adams and Yeboah, and both sides' recent accuracy is already counted, so I stay at about 8.9."},"sources":["https://www.fantamaster.it/probabili-formazioni-juventus-venezia-12-giornata-seriea-2026-2027/","https://www.pazzidifanta.com/news/juventus-venezia-probabili-formazioni-12a-giornata-serie-a-2026-27-460764","https://www.fantacalcio.it/news/calcio-italia/19_11_2026/juventus-in-emergenza-torna-la-difesa-a-tre-senza-kalulu-500839","https://www.sosfanta.com/squadra/juventus/juventus-